@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-10 - PayOS Payment Processing

actor "Guest" as Actor
boundary "Checkout / Payment UI" as FE
control "PaymentController" as API
control "PaymentService" as Service
database "MongoDB: bills, shoesDetail, coupons" as DB
participant "PayOS Gateway" as PayOS_Gateway

Actor -> FE: Start UC-10
FE -> API: POST /payments
API -> Service: Execute PayOS Payment Processing
Service -> DB: Read/write bills, shoesDetail, coupons
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service -> PayOS_Gateway: Create/verify PayOS transaction
PayOS_Gateway --> Service: PayOS result
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Payment hoàn tất hoặc hủy

alt Alternative / exception flow
  note over FE,Service: User hủy -> redirect về cancelUrl
  note over FE,Service: Webhook timeout -> user query GET /payments/check/:paymentLinkId or GET\n/payments/check-order/:orderCode
  note over FE,Service: Signature không hợp lệ -> 401
end

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Bill đã tạo, payment link pending
Post: Payment hoàn tất hoặc hủy
Main flow:
1. System tạo PayOS payment link với orderCode, amount, items, returnUrl,\ncancelUrl
2. PayOS trả về { checkoutUrl, qrCode }
3. System redirect user đến checkoutUrl
4. User thanh toán trên trang PayOS (QR code / bank transfer)
5. PayOS gửi webhook POST /payments/webhook
6. System verify HMAC signature
7. System cập nhật bill status = PAID
8. System giảm stock trong shoesDetail
9. System gửi email xác nhận
end note
@enduml
